From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:19:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Send the skype token to regional *.asm.skype.com media hosts

teams_download_uri_to_conv() only attached the skype_token cookie when the
URL host was exactly api.asm.skype.com. Personal accounts are served
media from region-prefixed hosts such as us-api.asm.skype.com and
nus1-api.asm.skype.com. Those downloads went out without the token, got a
401 error page back, and teams_got_imagemessage() dropped it, so the image
never showed. Match any *.asm.skype.com host.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 teams_contacts.c | 6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/teams_contacts.c b/teams_contacts.c
index 97511d9..a6d900e 100644
--- a/teams_contacts.c
+++ b/teams_contacts.c
@@ -378,7 +378,11 @@ teams_download_uri_to_conv(TeamsAccount *sa, const gchar *uri, PurpleConversatio
 	
 	static GRegex *skype_token_uri_regex = NULL;
 	if (skype_token_uri_regex == NULL) {
-		skype_token_uri_regex = g_regex_new("^https://api\\.asm\\.skype\\.com/|^https://[^\\.]*\\.asyncgw\\.teams\\.microsoft\\.com/", G_REGEX_OPTIMIZE, 0, NULL);
+		// webOS: match ANY *.asm.skype.com host, not just bare "api.asm.skype.com". Consumer/personal
+		// Teams serves media from region-prefixed hosts (us-api.asm.skype.com, nus1-api.asm.skype.com,
+		// ...); the old exact-match failed those, so the image download went out WITHOUT the skype_token
+		// cookie -> 401 -> an HTML/JSON body -> teams_got_imagemessage bailed -> empty bubble, no image.
+		skype_token_uri_regex = g_regex_new("^https://[^/]*\\.asm\\.skype\\.com/|^https://[^\\.]*\\.asyncgw\\.teams\\.microsoft\\.com/", G_REGEX_OPTIMIZE, 0, NULL);
 	}
 
 	//Only for skype domains
